sequenceDiagram
 actor Customer
 participant UI as Next.js UI
 participant API as NestJS API
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant Pay as VNPay Sandbox
 Customer->>UI: Choose options and checkout
 UI->>API: POST /orders with JWT
 API->>API: Validate JWT DTO options and price
 API->>DB: Transaction create PENDING order and snapshots
 DB-->>API: Order id and total
 API-->>UI: PENDING order
 alt Current browser checkout
 UI->>API: POST /orders/:id/retry-payment with JWT
 else Optional idempotent API client
 UI->>API: POST /payments with JWT and Idempotency-Key
 API->>DB: Lock order and create or reuse unique payment intent
 DB-->>API: Same intent and URL for repeated key
 end
 API->>API: Verify ownership and sign request
 API-->>UI: Signed Sandbox URL
 UI->>Pay: Browser redirect and authentication
 Pay->>API: Signed return or IPN
 API->>API: Verify signature amount and state
 alt Success
 API->>DB: Transaction duplicate check and inventory version CAS
 API->>DB: PAID payment and loyalty once
 DB-->>API: Commit
 else Failure
 API->>DB: PAYMENT_FAILED without stock deduction
 else Duplicate
 API->>DB: Read settled payment without repeated effects
 end
 API-->>Pay: Provider acknowledgement
 UI->>API: GET /orders/me with JWT
 API->>DB: Owner-filtered history
 DB-->>API: Current state
 API-->>UI: Server-confirmed result
 UI-->>Customer: Confirmation or retry
 Note over API,DB: Local integration verifies six concurrent same-key requests reuse one payment.
